{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205430","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205430","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1520543001:0":{"text":"……ゴウ、どうしてここに！？お前は戦場に来るな！早く逃げろ！獣どもが――","source_cn":"……高，你怎么在这里！你不应该上战场，快走！那些野兽会——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29DC2EDAEF902877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520543002:0":{"text":"オヤジ、戦争は……戦争はもう終わったんだ。","source_cn":"阿爹，战争……战争已经结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF42E5796AF611E57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520543003:0":{"text":"戦争が、終わった……？なら、俺は……","source_cn":"战争，结束了？我……那我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21EE42DC7C7001C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520543004:1":{"text":"獣群の主の元に、還っているはずでは……？","source_cn":"为什么，我没有回归兽群之主的怀抱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1663EE53EC7B64E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520543005:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……<key:dialog127>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x057B3D7C97663E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520543006:1":{"text":"……そうか、俺は負けたんだな。狩猟神様の御意志を果たせぬまま……欲深い毛無しどもに敗北してしまったから……！","source_cn":"……我知道了。因为我战败了。我没能践行狩猎神的神谕，败...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2B0BFCC31D67C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520543007:1":{"text":"いや、きっと同胞たちが使命を引き継いでくれたはずだ！ゴウ、教えてくれ、ヤクボルは戦争に勝ったんだよな？そうだろう？","source_cn":"没关系，我们的同胞将接替我继续这使命！高，告诉我，雅库...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x274714D0893E5EE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520543008:1":{"text":"オヤジ……ホーリンもヤクボルも、どっちも勝ってない。みんな負けたんだ。","source_cn":"……不，阿爹……没有人在这场战争中获胜。呼临人没有，雅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75034ECA85857B19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520543009:0":{"text":"オヤジが神の元に還ってないのは、神が堕落したからだよ。狩猟神は、俺たちを見捨てたんだ。","source_cn":"你没有回归狩猎神的拥抱，因为神明已经堕落。她背弃了我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE269E0638EDF2AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520543010:0":{"text":"話せば長くなるけど……","source_cn":"那是，很长很长的故事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC937D3D8B3F5BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士毛弯的灵魂":{"text":"戦士カウルの